/**
 * Ticket auto-reply: reads Ticket Tool's form embed and the user's later messages, and posts each new swap they name (then hands it to watchSwap).
 *
 * Every swap-shaped value (swap ID, encoded swap, tx hash, explorer link) is an equal lookup — Meson's search resolves them all the same way.
 * A wallet address is the only fallback: it is used only when nothing swap-shaped resolves *and* the ticket shows no swap yet — then its swaps that are not finished (Done, Released or Cancelled) are listed.
 */
// ----- Contents (generated by `npm run index` — do not edit) -----
// L29   Entry point
// L38     onTicketMessage()
// L47     admitMessage()
// L63     MESSAGE_ATTEMPTS
// L64     MESSAGE_RETRY_MS
